  "name": "Festering Maw shortens Lunge only when Bite Wound heals (#3091)",
  "contract": [
    "Festering Maw 706683 states: 'Healing with Bite Wound now reduces the cooldown of Lunge by 1 sec.' Spell.dbc",
    "gives 706683 Effect[0] aura 42 triggering Festering Maw 706718 (SPELL_EFFECT_ASCENSION_MODIFY_COOLDOWN,",
    "BasePoints -1001 = -1000 ms, MiscValue 500126 Lunge) with raw ProcFlags 4 (DONE_MELEE_AUTO_ATTACK). Per",
    "Bloodmage ADR 0036, spell_proc sets DisableEffectsMask 1 on 706683 so bare white swings without Bite Wound do",
    "not trigger 706718, while aura_ascension_bloodmage_bite_wound::HealCaster triggers 706718 whenever Bite Wound",
    "706654 heals the Bloodmage. Phase 1 proves bare melee auto-attacks without Bite Wound land at least one white",
    "hit and decay Lunge's 25 s cooldown only by elapsed wall time (<= 3400 ms over 3000 ms). Phase 2 casts",
    "Bloodfang Bite 572551 to apply Bite Wound 706654 (10 s duration), verifies Bite Wound stays active across the",
    "4500 ms melee window, and proves Bite Wound heals cut Lunge's cooldown by at least 5400 ms (elapsed 4500 ms plus",
    ">= 1000 ms CDR per heal)."
  ],
